    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64450" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαγύδαρις</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inflorescence of the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σίλφιον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.3.4
			</span></i>; also its <i>seed</i> (or <i>root</i>), <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.80
			</span></i>; also its <i>sap</i>, <i><span class="en">
